What:		/sys/devices/platform/display-subsystem/bg_color
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	6.14
Contact:	Kailash <kailash.sudhakar@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RW) Background colour of the S5L8720 CLCD mixer
		(CLCD_BG_COLOR0..2), shown where enabled layers do not cover or
		blend. Formatted as a 24-bit hex RGB value ("0x%06x"). Writing
		accepts integers in 0..0xffffff (base autodetected via
		kstrtou32); invalid values return -EINVAL. Saved across panel
		power cycles and system sleep.

What:		/sys/devices/platform/display-subsystem/mie
Date:		November 2026
KernelVersion:	6.14
Contact:	Kailash <kailash.sudhakar@gmail.com>
Description:
		(RW) Mobile Image Enhancement (MIE) adaptive contrast and
		backlight scaling mode of the S5L8720 CLCD.
		- 0: off
		- 1: automatic (enabled only while the CLCD video layer is active)
		- 2: always on
		Invalid values return -EINVAL.
